Spec: Fallback speed

Purpose:
  Display speed from two fixes when the GPS provider reports none, as iOS does while standing still.

Owns:
  ./fallback_speed.dart
  /test/domain/fallback_speed_test.dart

Must:
  Non-positive elapsed time gives no speed.
  A fix coarser than the accuracy limit gives no speed.
  Movement within the larger accuracy radius of the two fixes reads as `0`.
  An implied speed above the caller's maximum gives no speed.
  Thresholds come from the caller.

Must not:
  Feed recorded speeds; it is display only.
